  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "財富人生與實務規劃",
    "sub_ename": "LIFE WEALTH MANAGEMENT AND PRACTICAL PLANNING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在透過體驗式學習，引導學生建立正確的財富觀與財務規劃概念。課程以「財富流遊戲」啟動學習動機，並以「專案導向學習 (PBL)」貫穿，學生須持續追蹤與修正客戶的終身財務規劃書，學習如何應對人生各階段（如職涯、家庭、退休）的財務挑戰，以培養將知識應用於生活的實務能力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course utilizes experiential learning to help students establish sound wealth concepts and financial planning skills. It begins with a “Wealth Flow Game” to motivate learning, followed by Project-Based Learning (PBL). Students continuously track and revise a client’s lifetime financial plan, learning to navigate financial challenges at every stage (career, family, retirement).",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "能理解個人與家庭財富規劃的觀念與流程",
